port":"700x210","subtitle":"Vertical is the main logo. Wordmark for narrow strips, symbol for small sizes, seal for paperwork.","name":"Logo lockups"},{"path":"guidelines/pattern.html","group":"Brand","viewport":"700x230","subtitle":"Logo symbol rotated four ways into alternating star and plus motifs. Light coloring only.","name":"The pattern"},{"path":"guidelines/seal.html","group":"Brand","viewport":"700x210","subtitle":"A formal endorsement device for paperwork and trust moments. Never at button scale.","name":"The seal"},{"path":"guidelines/colors-accents.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"700x166","subtitle":"Used sparingly. Coral appears once in the official site; gold appears in no UI at all.","name":"Accents — coral &amp; gold"},{"path":"guidelines/colors-blue.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"700x166","subtitle":"Technology, connectivity, primary action. Blue means inbound and deposit.","name":"Blue — Transparent Blue"},{"path":"guidelines/colors-direction.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"700x190","subtitle":"The mark's arrows carry direction. The official website honours it; so must you.","name":"Blue = buy, teal = sell"},{"path":"guidelines/colors-navy.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"700x166","subtitle":"The primary trust and authority colour. Navy is the ground.","name":"Navy — Security Blue"},{"path":"guidelines/colors-neutrals.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"700x166","subtitle":"Every grey is blue-tinted. There is no neutral grey in this brand.","name":"Institutional neutrals"},{"path":"guidelines/colors-semantic.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"700x170","subtitle":"Escrow states map onto the palette: pending, funded, released, failed.","name":"Semantic states"},{"path":"guidelines/colors-teal.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"700x166","subtitle":"Active states, settlement, success. Teal means outbound and release.","name":"Teal — Growth &amp; Money"},{"path":"components/brand/brand.card.html","group":"Components","viewport":"700x330","subt